@startuml sd-set-duration
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
mainframe sd Set Duration E

actor "사용자" as User
participant "duration : JSpinner" as S
participant ":FreezingTools" as T

User -> S : 값 바꿈
note right of S : SpinnerNumberModel(5, 1, 999, 1)\n기본 5, 1~999만 받는다

== Freezing 설치를 누르면 ==

T -> S : getValue()
S --> T : generations
@enduml
